<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_15__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (4), by inserting after the word “Registrar” the words “or in a book to be kept by an officer in charge of a police station”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
