<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_1__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "This act may be cited as the Moneylenders (amendment) act 2010."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
