<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_22> <https://schema.org/text> "The principal act is amended by substituting for section 10j the following section: “Authority to act 10j. (1) There shall be issued to each inspector an authority card to be signed by the Minister. (2) Whenever an inspector exercises any of the powers under this act, he shall on demand produce to the person against whom the power is being exercised the authority card issued to him under subsection (1).”. Amendment of section 10k"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
