<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_24> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
