<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 1(2) of the principal act is amended by substituting for the words “States of Peninsular Malaysia only” the words “whole of Malaysia”. Amendment of section 2"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
