<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_47> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_47> <https://schema.org/text> "The Federal Territory of labuan (Extension and Modification of the Moneylenders act 1951) Order 2007 [P.U. (A) 413/2007] and the States of Sabah and Sarawak (Extension and Modification of the Moneylenders act 1951) Order 2007 [P.U. (A) 414/2007] are revoked."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
