<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting before the definitions of ‘ “authorized name” and “authorized address” ’ the following definition: ‘ “authority” has the same meaning assigned to it in the local Government Ordinance 1961 [Sabah Ord. 11/1961];’;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
