<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “licence” the following definitions: ‘ “licensee” means any moneylender to whom a licence has been issued under section 5b; “local authority” has the same meaning assigned to it in the local authorities Ordinance 1996 [Sarawak Ord. 20/1996];’;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_c> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "c" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_c> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_c> <https://schema.org/text> "by substituting for the definition of “moneylender” the following definition: ‘ “moneylender” means any person who carries on or advertises or announces himself or holds himself out in any way as carrying on the business of moneylending, whether or not he carries on any other business;’;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_d> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "d" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_d> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_d> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “moneylender” the following definition: ‘ “moneylending” means the lending of money at interest, with or without security, by a moneylender to a borrower;’;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_e> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
