<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@/~cl_4__para_e> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after the definition of “moneylending agreement” the following definition: ‘ “Perbadanan labuan” has the same meaning assigned to it in the Perbadanan labuan act 2001 [Act 609];” ’; (f) in the definition of “police officer”, by deleting the word “senior”; and (g) by inserting after the definition of “Registrar” the following definition: ‘ “senior police officer” means a senior police officer as defined in the Police act 1967;’. Amendment of section 2a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2010/28/eng@> .
